flowchart TB
  SPEC[Versioned typed specification] --> COMPILE[Validate units, graph, rate and FIR response]
  COST[Measured host primitive costs; MCU costs unknown] --> PLAN[Deterministic legal prefix planner]
  COMPILE --> PLAN
  PLAN --> BIND[Configuration hash, C bindings and epoch]
  subgraph MCU[Provisional Zephyr adapter: build verified; hardware unverified]
    IRQ[ADXL345 mature driver / acquisition thread] --> Q[Bounded queue; fail on overrun]
    Q --> EDGE[Calibration and FIR prefix, when selected]
    STOP[Start / keepalive / synchronized stop] --> IRQ
  end
  BIND --> MCU
  EDGE --> WIRE[IZP1: length, kind, UUID, epoch, sequence, timestamps, CRC]
  SIM[Explicitly synthetic source] --> WIRE
  WAV[Consented signed PCM recording / unknown prior gain and clock] --> WIRE
  subgraph HOST[Local host application]
    CHECK[Validate contract; invalidate faults and stale epochs] --> CORE[Shared C suffix + float64 numerical reference]
    CORE --> FIT[Single-mode ringdown; reject unsuitable signal / unidentifiable damping]
    FIT --> UI[Task-centered Edge workspace]
    FIT --> ZIP[Raw samples, original packets, config, firmware declaration, source and recompute]
    CHECK -. raw evidence .-> ZIP
  end
  WIRE --> CHECK
  BIND --> HOST
  REF[Fresh independent physical reference: unavailable] -. required before measurement verification .-> FIT
